#: ../../../reference/interfaces/usb-gadget-interface.md:2
msgid "usb-gadget interface"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/usb-gadget-interface.md:4
msgid ""
"The `usb-gadget` interface permits snaps to access the [USB Gadget API]"
"(https://www.kernel.org/doc/html/v4.17/driver-api/usb/gadget.html) using "
"[configfs](https://www.kernel.org/doc/Documentation/filesystems/configfs/"
"configfs.txt)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/usb-gadget-interface.md:6
msgid ""
"USB gadget is a feature of the Linux kernel that allows USB connected "
"devices to identify as USB peripherals, such as USB keyboards or storage "
"devices. They are unrelated to [Ubuntu Core gadget snaps](https://"
"documentation.ubuntu.com/core/reference/gadget-snap-format/)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/usb-gadget-interface.md:8
msgid ""
"The usb-gadget interface requires snapd version _2.71+_. Prior to snapd "
"2.72,  function filesystem devices need `mount-control` and `system-files` "
"interfaces to provide the necessary permissions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/usb-gadget-interface.md:10
msgid "Developer details"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/usb-gadget-interface.md:12
msgid "**Auto-connect**: no"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/usb-gadget-interface.md:14
msgid ""
"The USB Gadget API, through configfs, can be loaded through libcomposite "
"which then provides `/sys/kernel/config/usb_gadget/` . This can then be used "
"to create and discover new USB gadgets. This interface allows snaps to read "
"and write to those paths."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/usb-gadget-interface.md:16
msgid ""
"USB gadgets using the [function filesystem](https://www.kernel.org/doc/"
"Documentation/usb/functionfs.txt) can use a definition based on the "
"following:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/usb-gadget-interface.md:18
msgid ""
"  usb-gadget:\n"
"    interface: usb-gadget\n"
"    ffs-mounts:\n"
"      - name: ffs-dev0\n"
"        where: /dev/ffs-dev0\n"
"        persistent: {true,false}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/usb-gadget-interface.md:27
msgid "Code examples"
msgstr ""

